@startuml
title Varan MIS - Activity Flows

start
:User opens new production report;
:Select product group;
:UI filters line, product, operator, material, and waste choices;
:Enter date, shift, crew count, total and useful production;
:Add material rows as needed;
:Add waste rows as needed;
if (Duplicate date + line + shift?) then (yes)
  :Show validation error;
  stop
endif
if (Useful production > total production?) then (yes)
  :Show validation error;
  stop
endif
if (Group mismatch?) then (yes)
  :Show validation error;
  stop
endif
:Save report;
:Open detail page;
:User may export PDF/Excel;
stop

@enduml
